|1.1.0.300|2020-10-23|![](https://contentcenter-vali-drcn.dbankcdn.cn/pvt_2/DeveloperAlliance_scene_100_1/fc/v3/9fCdR4GaQ-qlxNZU-i00Iw/zh-cn_image_0000001057753890.png?HW-CC-KV=V1&HW-CC-Date=20260916T034030Z&HW-CC-Expire=31536000000&HW-CC-Sign=DF8F430DBCD479D520D617BD5790BC090C1DB7CC5EB379EEC815DAC0DBBFEBA2) * AGCAuth类新增[revokeRefreshTokens](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/auth-serversdk-agcauth-0000001055003341#section534993917101)和[verifyAccessToken](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/auth-serversdk-agcauth-0000001055003341#section64145573107)方法。 * 新增[AuthAccessToken](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/auth-serversdk-authaccesstoken-0000001055124700)、[ProviderInfo](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/auth-serversdk-providerinfo-0000001055244739)、[Provider](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/auth-serversdk-provider-0000001054964724)类。 * 新增错误码参考1007、1008、2020、2021、2022、2023、2024、2025、2026、2027、2028、2029（参见[AuthErrorCode](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/AppGallery-connect-References/auth-serversdk-autherrorcode-0000001055283310)）。|
